---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const ctaMailto = 'mailto:eric@ericangella.com?subject=Strategy%20Call%20-%20LinkedIn%20Authority';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="LinkedIn Authority — Eric Angella"
  description="Ghostwritten thought leadership that builds enterprise credibility for technology executives."
>
  <a href="/work" class="back">← Work</a>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="lp-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">LinkedIn Thought Leadership for Technology Executives</p>
    <h1>LinkedIn Authority for <em>Serious</em> Tech Executives</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Ghostwritten thought leadership that builds enterprise credibility —
      not content noise.
    </p>
    <p class="lp-body">
      If you're running a $5–20M technology company, your LinkedIn presence
      should reflect it. Most don't. You're either invisible — or posting
      sporadically — or outsourcing to someone who doesn't understand your
      business.
    </p>
    <p class="lp-body">
      I help founders and executives turn their real thinking into strategic
      long-form LinkedIn articles that signal competence, attract the right
      conversations, and close the credibility gap before the first sales
      call.
    </p>
    <a href={ctaMailto} class="btn-primary">Book a Strategy Call →</a>
  </section>

  <hr class="rule" />

  <!-- THE PROBLEM -->
  <p class="section-label">The Problem</p>
  <h2 class="lp-h2">You're Being Researched. Constantly.</h2>
  <p class="lp-body lp-max">
    Most executives underestimate how often LinkedIn acts as a credibility
    filter. Before they act — they look you up.
  </p>

  <dl class="lp-lookup-list">
    <div class="lp-lookup-row"><dt>Enterprise deals</dt><dd>close</dd></div>
    <div class="lp-lookup-row"><dt>Investors</dt><dd>commit</dd></div>
    <div class="lp-lookup-row"><dt>Candidates</dt><dd>accept offers</dd></div>
    <div class="lp-lookup-row"><dt>Partners</dt><dd>respond</dd></div>
  </dl>
  <p class="lp-body lp-max">What they find determines how seriously they take you.</p>

  <div class="lp-numbered-list">
    <div class="lp-numbered-item">
      <span class="lp-num">1</span>
      <div>
        <h3>One post a month</h3>
        <p>Disappears. No compounding. No pattern recognition.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-numbered-item">
      <span class="lp-num">2</span>
      <div>
        <h3>Random posting</h3>
        <p>Creates noise instead of signal. Confuses your market.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-numbered-item">
      <span class="lp-num">3</span>
      <div>
        <h3>Silence</h3>
        <p>Creates doubt. Enterprise buyers interpret it as a gap.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="rule" />

  <!-- THE APPROACH -->
  <p class="section-label">The Approach</p>
  <h2 class="lp-h2">This Isn't Daily Posting. <em>It's Strategic Authority.</em></h2>
  <p class="lp-body lp-max">This is not:</p>
  <ul class="lp-x-list">
    <li>Chasing algorithms</li>
    <li>Producing fluff</li>
    <li>"10 tips" content</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="lp-body lp-max">We extract your real thinking and turn it into:</p>
  <ul class="lp-plain-list">
    <li>Clear positions</li>
    <li>Strong opinions</li>
    <li>Enterprise-ready articles</li>
    <li>Signal-generating narratives</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="lp-body lp-max">The goal is simple: build durable authority in your market.</p>

  <hr class="rule" />

  <!-- WHAT YOU GET -->
  <p class="section-label">What You Get</p>
  <h2 class="lp-h2">The LinkedIn Authority Retainer</h2>

  <div class="lp-offer-grid">
    <div class="lp-offer">
      <p class="lp-offer-num">1 — Strategic Discovery</p>
      <p class="lp-offer-desc">Establish the narrative foundation before a single word is written.</p>
      <ul class="lp-plain-list">
        <li>60–90 min Authority Interview</li>
        <li>Narrative Positioning Workshop</li>
        <li>Buyer Alignment</li>
        <li>Competitive Scan</li>
        <li>Content Thesis Mapping</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-offer">
      <p class="lp-offer-num">2 — LinkedIn Profile Upgrade <span class="lp-tag">Month 1</span></p>
      <p class="lp-offer-desc">Your profile is the first credibility signal. We rebuild it from the ground up.</p>
      <ul class="lp-plain-list">
        <li>Headline Rewrite</li>
        <li>About Section Overhaul</li>
        <li>Experience Reframing</li>
        <li>Featured Section Strategy</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-offer">
      <p class="lp-offer-num">3 — Monthly Authority Interview</p>
      <p class="lp-offer-desc">A live 60-minute session to extract your ideas, perspectives, and signal. Your thinking becomes the source material.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-offer">
      <p class="lp-offer-num">4 — Ghostwritten Articles</p>
      <p class="lp-offer-desc">4 articles per month. 800–1,000 words. Strategic hooks, strong positioning, publishing-ready.</p>
      <ul class="lp-plain-list">
        <li>Strategic Hooks</li>
        <li>Strong Positioning</li>
        <li>Publishing-Ready Drafts</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-offer">
      <p class="lp-offer-num">5 — Engagement Support</p>
      <p class="lp-offer-desc">Suggested strategic comments, occasional ghostwritten comment threads, and guidance on where to engage.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-offer">
      <p class="lp-offer-num">6 — Analytics & Signal Report</p>
      <p class="lp-offer-desc">Monthly traction analysis — what resonated, what didn't, what to double down on, and how your narrative is evolving.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="lp-body lp-max lp-italic">You handle DMs and inbound leads. You stay authentic. I handle structure and clarity.</p>

  <hr class="rule" />

  <!-- PRICING -->
  <p class="section-label">Pricing</p>
  <h2 class="lp-h2">Authority Packages</h2>

  <div class="lp-pricing-sheet">
    <div class="lp-price-row">
      <div class="lp-price-name">
        <h3>Foundation Authority</h3>
        <p>For executives building visibility from near-zero.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-price-amount">$3k<span>/mo</span></div>
      <ul class="lp-plain-list">
        <li>4 articles per month</li>
        <li>Monthly authority interview</li>
        <li>Profile upgrade (Month 1)</li>
        <li>Basic analytics</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="lp-price-row lp-price-featured">
      <div class="lp-price-name">
        <h3>Momentum Authority <span class="lp-tag">Most Popular</span></h3>
        <p>For executives in active growth mode.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-price-amount">$5k<span>/mo</span></div>
      <ul class="lp-plain-list">
        <li>6–8 articles per month</li>
        <li>Expanded signal analysis</li>
        <li>Narrative arcs across the month</li>
        <li>Light strategic advisory</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="lp-price-row">
      <div class="lp-price-name">
        <h3>Market Leader Authority</h3>
        <p>For executives positioning as category leaders.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-price-amount">$7.5k<span>/mo</span></div>
      <ul class="lp-plain-list">
        <li>8 articles per month</li>
        <li>Deeper positioning strategy</li>
        <li>Ongoing advisory</li>
        <li>Structured engagement support</li>
        <li>Quarterly authority roadmap</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="rule" />

  <!-- LOW FRICTION ENTRY -->
  <p class="section-label">Low-Friction Entry</p>
  <h2 class="lp-h2">Not Ready for a Retainer?</h2>
  <p class="lp-body lp-max">Start with a standalone engagement to experience the work before committing.</p>

  <div class="lp-entry-grid">
    <div class="lp-entry">
      <div class="lp-price-amount lp-price-small">$1,250</div>
      <h3>Single Authority Article</h3>
      <p>Includes interview + 800–1,000 word article. Fully ghostwritten, publishing-ready.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-entry">
      <div class="lp-price-amount lp-price-small">$1,500</div>
      <h3>LinkedIn Profile Overhaul</h3>
      <p>Headline, about section, experience reframing, and featured section strategy.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-entry">
      <div class="lp-price-amount lp-price-small">$2,000</div>
      <h3>Authority Strategy Assessment</h3>
      <p>Includes a 90-day authority roadmap tailored to your market and positioning.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="rule" />

  <!-- WHO THIS IS FOR -->
  <p class="section-label">Who This Is For</p>
  <h2 class="lp-h2">Right Fit. Wrong Fit.</h2>

  <div class="lp-fit-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="lp-fit-label">This is for you</p>
      <ul class="lp-plain-list">
        <li>$5–20M revenue tech founders</li>
        <li>Executives selling complex solutions</li>
        <li>Leaders entering enterprise deal cycles</li>
        <li>CEOs who want credibility, not clout</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="lp-fit-label">This is not for you</p>
      <ul class="lp-x-list">
        <li>Influencer-style daily posters</li>
        <li>Founders chasing vanity metrics</li>
        <li>Early-stage companies without positioning clarity</li>
        <li>Anyone unwilling to share real thinking</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="rule" />

  <!-- WHY IT WORKS -->
  <p class="section-label">Why It Works</p>
  <h2 class="lp-h2">LinkedIn Is the Default Research Layer.</h2>
  <p class="lp-body lp-max">Long-form thought leadership does what ads and outreach can't.</p>

  <div class="lp-why-grid">
    <div class="lp-why-item">
      <span class="lp-glyph">↗</span>
      <p><strong>Shortens trust curves</strong> — Buyers arrive pre-convinced. Deals move faster.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-why-item">
      <span class="lp-glyph">◎</span>
      <p><strong>Attracts inbound conversations</strong> — The right people reach out. You stop chasing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-why-item">
      <span class="lp-glyph">◈</span>
      <p><strong>Shapes category perception</strong> — You define the frame. Competitors react to you.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-why-item">
      <span class="lp-glyph">⊞</span>
      <p><strong>Supports enterprise sales</strong> — Every article becomes a sales asset your team can leverage.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <blockquote class="lp-quote">This is reputation infrastructure.</blockquote>

  <hr class="rule" />

  <!-- ABOUT -->
  <p class="section-label">About</p>
  <h2 class="lp-h2">Eric Angella</h2>
  <p class="lp-body lp-max">
    I work with technology founders and executives to turn complex thinking
    into clear authority. My focus is not volume. It's leverage.
  </p>
  <ul class="lp-plain-list lp-max">
    <li>Every article reflects executive-level thinking</li>
    <li>Strengthens enterprise credibility</li>
    <li>Compounds over time</li>
  </ul>
  <blockquote class="lp-quote lp-quote-small">No fluff. No ghostwriting factory. No junior writers.</blockquote>
  <ul class="lp-arrow-list">
    <li>You work directly with me</li>
    <li>Your ideas remain yours</li>
    <li>Structure and clarity handled completely</li>
  </ul>

  <hr class="rule" />

  <!-- FINAL CTA -->
  <section class="lp-final">
    <p class="section-label">Ready</p>
    <h2 class="lp-h2">If You're Ready to Be Taken Seriously Online</h2>
    <p class="lp-body lp-max">
      Book a strategy call. Let's assess your current positioning, your
      market opportunity, and whether this is a fit.
    </p>
    <ul class="lp-plain-list lp-max">
      <li>Your current positioning</li>
      <li>Your market opportunity</li>
      <li>Whether this is a fit</li>
    </ul>
    <a href={ctaMailto} class="btn-primary">Book a Strategy Call →</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .back {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 60px;
  }
  .back:hover {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .lp-max {
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  /* Hero */
  .lp-hero {
    padding: 20px 0 0;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .lp-hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 6.5vw, 50px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    max-width: 620px;
  }
  .lp-hero h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .lede {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 19px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 26px;
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .lp-body {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
  .lp-italic {
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .lp-h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 4.5vw, 34px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 4px 0 22px;
    max-width: 620px;
  }
  .lp-h2 em {
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* CTA button — the one place we break monochrome-on-dark by inverting */
  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--text);
    color: var(--bg);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 14px 26px;
    margin: 8px 0 44px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
    color: var(--bg);
  }

  /* Lookup list */
  .lp-lookup-list {
    margin: 28px 0;
    max-width: 420px;
  }
  .lp-lookup-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .lp-lookup-row dt {
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .lp-lookup-row dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    font-style: italic;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
  }

  /* Numbered failure list */
  .lp-numbered-list {
    margin: 30px 0 10px;
  }
  .lp-numbered-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 22px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .lp-numbered-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .lp-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }
  .lp-numbered-item h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 19px;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }
  .lp-numbered-item p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Lists */
  .lp-plain-list, .lp-x-list, .lp-arrow-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
  }
  .lp-plain-list li {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding: 8px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .lp-plain-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .lp-x-list li {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    padding: 8px 0 8px 26px;
    position: relative;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .lp-x-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .lp-x-list li::before {
    content: '✗';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }
  .lp-arrow-list li {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding: 6px 0 6px 22px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .lp-arrow-list li::before {
    content: '→';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }

  /* Offer grid */
  .lp-offer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    margin: 30px 0;
  }
  .lp-offer-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }
  .lp-offer-desc {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .lp-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: var(--text);
    color: var(--bg);
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-left: 8px;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  /* Pricing sheet */
  .lp-pricing-sheet {
    margin: 30px 0;
  }
  .lp-price-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 0.8fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 30px;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 34px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .lp-price-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .lp-price-featured {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--text-faint);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--text-faint);
  }
  .lp-price-name h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 22px;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .lp-price-name p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .lp-price-amount {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 34px;
  }
  .lp-price-amount span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }
  .lp-price-small {
    font-size: 26px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  /* Low friction entry grid */
  .lp-entry-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
    margin: 30px 0;
  }
  .lp-entry h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 19px;
    margin: 4px 0 8px;
  }
  .lp-entry p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Fit grid */
  .lp-fit-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 50px;
    margin: 26px 0;
  }
  .lp-fit-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  /* Why it works */
  .lp-why-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 30px 40px;
    margin: 30px 0;
  }
  .lp-why-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .lp-glyph {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .lp-why-item p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .lp-why-item strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .lp-quote {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--line);
    padding-left: 22px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 24px;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 34px 0;
  }
  .lp-quote-small {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .lp-final {
    padding-bottom: 20px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .lp-offer-grid,
    .lp-entry-grid,
    .lp-fit-grid,
    .lp-why-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .lp-price-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>
